Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你看這個
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.37,0:16:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.67,0:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,兩千
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,為、為什麼會變這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是上次那個人傳開的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,上次那個人
